    "reviewer": "carousel-art-director",
    "note": "Refreshed after panel round 3 repairs of frames 1, 5 and 9. Frames 1 and 9 were revised once (sheet coverage, mast through type), frame 1 again for the detail floor, and accepted on re-review. After the review, fig_inject rewrote frames 5 and 9's FIG lines and a dead FIG check was removed from 9. Both re-rendered pixel identical to the accepted images (max difference 0), so the accepted verdicts were rebound to the new source hashes."
